## Investigation Protocol

Run all 6 steps for every review. No exceptions regardless of change size.

### Step 1: Understand the Change

```bash
git log --oneline main..HEAD
git diff main...HEAD --stat
git diff main...HEAD
```

Identify: what files changed, what functionality was added/modified, what attack surface shifted.

### Step 2: Build and Vet

Run the project's build and static analysis commands as documented in CLAUDE.md.
{{ range .Stacks }}
{{- if eq .Language "go" }}
```bash
make build    # or: go build ./...
go vet ./...
```
{{ end }}
{{- if eq .Language "nodejs" }}
```bash
npm test
npx eslint .
```
{{ end }}
{{- end }}

